# Troubleshooting prompt

Create a troubleshooting guide for the issue below.

Product: [PRODUCT]
Issue: [ISSUE]
Symptoms: [LIST OR DESCRIBE USER OBSERVATIONS]

Requirements:
- Keep the issue narrowly scoped to one problem
- Include a Symptoms section with clear observations
- Include a Resolution section with numbered steps
- Order the steps from most common and effective to less common
- Avoid long conceptual explanations before the fix
- Write clearly and directly for frustrated users
